  LanguageConfig_2ndAnniversaryText_CN = {
    Text = [[
No matter where you are, %player%.
Mythag has been trying to make a dimensional link, and perhaps we will see each other again soon.
Doll said she has pinpointed the dimension you are in, and I can't describe the joy it brings to my heart.
Even though I prefer clear, precise, and well-defined things, in this matter, any vague or even unrealistic hope is welcome.
I can hardly imagine a separation that will never lead to a reunion over a long wait.
If this time doesn't work, that's fine; next time, or the time after that, or a thousand times, no matter how many times it takes, all of us from Mythag will surely bring you back.
Although we are in two dimensions now, Mythag is still finding ways to gather some possibilities with Silver Technology to assist you. Please gather our past memories, create new memories, and let these gifts help you.
We all know you will definitely come back.
Because I am very good at waiting.]]
