  LanguageConfig_AwakerFavorability_Description_Detail_CN = {
    Text = "<Title:[Affinity Acquisition]>\nComplete stages such as Investigations, Special Ops, Psyche Deepdive, and Phantasmal Dive to gain Affinity with deployed Awakeners.\nThe more cards an Awakener plays and the more Arithmetica and Aliemus consumed, the more Affinity gained; the higher the stage's recommended level, the more Affinity gained.\nThe more of the Keeper's Keyflare consumed, the more Affinity deployed Awakeners gain.\nAffinity gained during manual combat is 3 times that of when \"Auto-Combat\" is enabled.\nAfter clearing a stage using Support, your own Awakeners gain 50% more Affinity.\nAfter inviting an Awakener into the Dormitory, 1 Affinity point can be gained every 5 minutes.\nOnce offline storage exceeds 300 points, the acquisition rate drops to 1 point every 15 minutes, with a maximum storage of 3000 points.\n\n<Title:[Affinity Level]>\nIncreasing Affinity Levels grants Pure Cores and unlocks more Voice lines and Stories.\nAfter an Awakener's Affinity reaches Lv15, you can use \"Somatic Sync\" to consume \"Token of Concord\" to gradually raise the level cap to Lv20. Each level grants \"Refined Gnosis Fragment\" ×5, and reaching Lv20 additionally grants \"Scintilla.\"\nOnce an Awakener's Affinity reaches the current level cap, it will no longer accumulate; you must first complete Somatic Sync to continue gaining Affinity."
