  LanguageConfig_BackTrack_CN = {Text = "Reset"},
  LanguageConfig_BacktrackAwaker_Rules_CN = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[Development Reset]>
This operation will reset all upgrades, edifications, skills, and Gnostic Advance states of the Awakener. All consumed materials and gold vouchers will be fully returned.
All consumed Realm Edify Materials by the Awakener will be returned as "Basic Edify Coffer," "Medium Edify Coffer," or "Premium Edify Coffer" of equivalent quantity and rarity. You can choose any Realm Edify Materials of equivalent quantity and rarity.
All consumed Realm Skill Materials by the Awakener will be returned as "Basic Skill Supplies," "Medium Skill Supplies," or "Premium Skill Supplies" of equivalent quantity and rarity. You can choose any Realm Skill Materials of equivalent quantity and rarity.
All consumed "Lucky Candy," "Wax Sculpture Clay," "Ebon Shackles," "Dimension Crystal," and "Devout Soul" by the Awakener will be returned as 30 times the quantity of "Mimetic Crystal".
<Title:[Enlightenment Reset]>
This operation will reset the Enlightenment state of the Awakener and reset the Level Cap brought by Enlightenment. All consumed materials will be fully returned.
All consumed or unused Enlightenment Shards by the Awakener will be returned as different items based on their Obtain Source.
Those obtained from "Prototype Horizon" will be returned as "Prototype Horizon".
Those converted from Limited-Time Awakeners will be returned as "Soul Rewind Core".
"Doll," "Ogier," and "Lotan" will return "Investigation Badge" *2500.
"Ramona" and "Timeworn: Ramona" will return "Shard: Ramona".
Aigis, Aurita, and Erica will return D-Jewel *8000.
Those obtained through other means will be returned as Protoparadise.

<Title:[Genesis Return]>
In addition to all the effects of "Development Reset," this operation will also reset the Awakener itself, returning it to an unlocked state.
The Awakener's equipped Wheel of Destiny and Covenant will be removed, and its avatar will become unavailable. If currently in use, it will switch to the default avatar.
The Awakener's Edify Reward receipt status, Affinity, and Affinity Reward receipt status will all be retained and inherited when obtaining the Awakener again.
The Awakener itself will be returned as different items depending on its source. Limited-Time Awakeners obtained through Limited-Time Awakening will be returned as "Soul Rewind Core"; those obtained through other means will be returned as "Protoparadise".
<Title:[Item Description]>
"Basic Edify Coffer": When used, you can choose one of Pale Notes, Tempered Instinct, Memory Replica, or Cognitive Template.
"Medium Edify Coffer": When used, you can choose one of Pale Files, Tempered Reason, Emotion Replica, or Psyche Template.
"Premium Edify Coffer": When used, you can choose one of Pale Tomes, Tempered Spirit, Sentience Replica, or Gnosis Template.
"Basic Skill Supplies": When used, you can choose one of Faded Crystalfly, Short Sea Lily, Dried Pupa, or Damaged Ore.
"Medium Skill Supplies": When used, you can choose any one of the following: Shining Crystalfly, Tall Sea Lily, Worm Pupa, or Meteorite Fragment.
"Premium Skill Supplies": When used, you can choose any one of the following: Chaos Crystal, Uintacrinus, Spore Polymer, or Yucatan's Star.
"Prototype Horizon": When used, you can select a shard of an unlocked SSR Character Awakener.
"Protoparadise": When used, you can select an Awakener from "Realms Research".
"Soul Rewind Core": When used, you can select an Awakener from "Realms Research," past Character Events, and current Character Events.]]
  },
