  LanguageConfig_BacktrackWeapon_Rules_CN = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[Ascension Recovery]>
This operation will reset all ascension states of the Wheel of Destiny, and all consumed materials will be fully refunded.
stacks activated through "Timeloop Copy" will be refunded as "Timeloop Copy"; stacks activated from limited awakenings will be refunded as "Fate Rewind Core"; and stacks activated through other means will be refunded as "Book of Rotation."
<Title:[Black Pool Refund]>
This operation, in addition to all effects of "Development Reset," will also reset the Wheel of Destiny itself.
The limited Wheel of Destiny obtained from limited awakenings will be refunded as "Fate Rewind Core"; those obtained through other means will be refunded as "Book of Rotation."
<Title:[Item Description]>
The following items can be used in the Inventory interface.
"Timeloop Copy": Can be used as an upgrade material for any SSR Wheel of Destiny.
"Book of Rotation": When used, you can choose one from the "Wheels of Rotation" SSR Wheels of Destiny.
"Fate Rewind Core": When used, you can choose one from the "Wheels of Rotation," previous Wheel of Destiny events, and current Wheel of Destiny events.]]
