  LanguageConfig_DailyChallengeInstructionsExample_CN = {
    Text = "({s1})\"{s2}\": {s3}"
  },
  LanguageConfig_DailyChallengeInstructionsV2_CN = {
    Text = "<Title:[Phantasmal Dive]>\nInitial Relics and Stage Relics refresh every Monday at 9:00 AM (GMT+8).\nEach challenge randomly enters a unique scenario.\n<Title:[Deep Dive EXP]>\nWhen \"Keeper Level\" aligns with the Stage's recommended level, completing the challenge fulfills Deep Dive Achievements and grants \"Deep Dive EXP\".\n\"Challenge Journey\": Earn base Deep Dive EXP when the challenge difficulty's \"Recommended Level\" exceeds \"Keeper Level\" - 40.\n\"Transcendence Journey\": Warn additional base Deep Dive EXP when the challenge difficulty's \"Recommended Level\" exceeds \"Keeper Level\" - 20.\n<Title:[Deep Dive Level]>\nUpon reaching sufficient Deep Dive EXP, Deep Dive Level increases. Each level up grants abundant rewards.\n<Title:[Season Update]>\nSeason typically resets every 28 days.\nInvestigation scores are calculated upon completion. Each season records the highest investigation score for rankings. Repeated attempts can improve scores. Identical scores result in tied rankings.\nAt season end, rankings are finalized and rewards delivered via mail. Access ranking rewards through \"Leaderboard\" —\"Rewards\".\nEach season features Seasonal Quests. Completing them grants abundant rewards. Quests reset at season end.\n<Title: [Seasonal Awakener Enhancement]>\nEach season, two random Awakeners per Realm become frenzied during Phantasmal Dive, increasing CON, ATK, and DEF by 50%.\n<Title: [Investigation Score]>\nInvestigation scores combine the Stage's base difficulty score with completed scoring items. Higher difficulty yields higher base scores.\nScoring items:\n1. \"Sandglass\": The initial round count is 50, with an additional 20 points for each remaining round.\n2. \"Abyss Summon\": When 1 / 2 / 3 / 4 enhanced Awakeners are deployed, earn 250 / 500 / 750 / 1000 points.\n3. \"Timely Rescue\": Each time 1 Emergency Gnosis is used, the investigation score -20%, with multiple triggers multiplying the reduction.\n4. \"Phantasmal Pioneer\": Earn 500 points for the first play of each day."
  },
  LanguageConfig_DailyChallengeInstructions_CN = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Phantasmal Dive>
Initial Relics and stage Relics change every Monday at 9:00 (GMT+8).
Each challenge randomly enters a different challenge scene.

<Title:Dive EXP>
Keepers gain "Dive EXP" by clearing Dive achievements when their "Keeper Level" is close to the stage's recommended level.
"Challenge Journey": Obtain basic Dive EXP when the recommended level is higher than [Keeper Level - 40].
"Transcendence Journey": Obtain an additional portion of basic Dive EXP when the recommended level is higher than [Keeper Level - 20].

<Title:Dive Level>
As Dive EXP reaches certain milestones, your Dive Level increases, granting abundant rewards at each level.

<Title:Season Reset>
Under normal circumstances, seasons reset every 28 days.
Investigations grant a score. The highest score each season is recorded for the seasonal ranking. You may repeat investigations to improve your score. Tied scores result in the same rank.
Seasonal rankings are settled at the end of each season, and ranking rewards are sent via mail. View rewards via "Leaderboard" - "Ranking Rewards."
Each season features seasonal missions. Complete them to earn abundant rewards. Seasonal missions reset at the end of the season.

<Title:Seasonal Enhanced Awakeners>
Each season, two random Awakeners from each Realm become "Manic" in Phantasmal Dive, increasing their CON, ATK, and DEF by 50%.

<Title:Investigation Score>
Scores are calculated based on the stage's base difficulty score and completed scoring items. Higher difficulties offer higher base scores.
Scoring items:
1. "Sandglass": Starts at 50 turns; gain 20 points for each remaining turn.
2. "Call of the Abyss": Gain 250 / 500 points for deploying 1/2 Enhanced Awakeners.
3. "Phantasmal Rescue": Each use of Emergency Gnosis reduces the investigation score by 20% (multiplicative).
4. "Dream Pioneer": Gain 500 points for the first play of the day.]]
  },
