: Keepers can exchange items at various Exchange Shops by spending the corresponding currency.
: When a Keeper's Investigation Level increases, the Exchange Shop will upgrade accordingly and unlock new content.
: Items in the Exchange Shop will automatically restock after a set period of time.

<Title:Rose Scrip Exchange>
: Keepers can obtain "Rose Scrip" by clearing a main story Investigation Event for the first time, or through "Dissolution Ruins: Rose Scrip Hunting," "Assignment Rewards," "Course Rewards," and limited-time event rewards.

<Title:Radix Sediment Exchange>
: Keepers can obtain "Radix Sediment" by Awakening.

<Title:Investigation Exchange>
: Keepers can obtain "Investigation Badge" by achieving a three-star rating in main story Investigation Event stages or through "Arcane Dominion".

<Title:Lightless Exchange>
: Keepers can obtain "Black Offering" through "Lightless Realm" or "D-Effect Zone".

<Title:D-Jewel Exchange>
: Keepers can obtain "D-Jewel" through "Training Tasks: Weekly Trial".]]
