  LanguageConfig_FriendInvitationRule_CN = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Mythag Enrollment Invite>
1. Invite new Keepers to join Mythag by sharing invitation codes, embarking on an adventurous journey together.
2. After the invited Keepers complete their tasks, you can claim task rewards to obtain "Glimmer". When the amount of "Glimmer" reaches certain goals, you can claim various rewards!
3. When the invited Keeper's Level reaches 5/10/15/20, you can obtain 20/20/20/40 respectively  "Glimmer".
4. Each Keeper can obtain task rewards from at most 50 invited Keepers; no further rewards will be provided for exceeding this number.
5. The invited Keepers will only be counted toward the total number of invitations after their Keeper Level reaches Level 5.
<Title:Bind Invitation>
1. Keepers can fill in the invitation code to bind with the inviting player and immediately receive a reward of Silver*300!
2. Each Keeper can only enter an invitation code within the first 7 days after arriving at Mythag. After this period, the "Bind Invite" option will be closed.]]
