  LanguageConfig_RailWayLevelAdjustmentTipsContent_CN = {
    Text = [[
In the "Hectic Skybound Rail," there is a Level Compensation mechanism, with the following rules: 
Awakeners in the investigation team with a level below 60 will be compensated to level 60 for this challenge. 
Awakeners in the investigation team with a skill level below 5 will be compensated to level 5 for this challenge. 
Awakeners in the investigation team with "Madness Omen" below level 6 will be compensated to level 6 for this challenge. 
Awakeners in the investigation team with "Soulforge Aptitude" below level 5 will be compensated to level 5 for this challenge. 
If the Keeper's level is below 60, they will be compensated to level 60 for this challenge.]]
