  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_1_CN = {
    Text = "At node [A Gift of Kindness], add 1 \"Innocent Return Gift\" to deck— 1 Arithmetica Cost, give 30 Aliemus to the Awakener with the least Aliemus, Exhaust."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_24_CN = {
    Text = "In the \"Path of Madness\" Event, choose an Awakener to become schizofrenic, losing their initial 4 Command Cards. Afterward, the path forward will appear, allowing you to obtain a Golden Relic (3 choices, select 1). You can gradually recover the lost Command Cards in the next four \"Consciousness Fragment\" events. Recovered Command Cards will directly possess a unique <EnsembleKeywords:\"Ensemble\"> Orison."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_2_CN = {
    Text = "At node [Unfinished Wax Sculpture], choose 1 card and reduce its Arithmetica Cost by 1."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_3_CN = {
    Text = "At the node [Strange Pustule], add \"Mutated Heart\" to the deck, 0 Arithmetica Cost. Discard all cards in hand and draw a number of cards equal to the discarded count +1. Exhaust."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_4_CN = {
    Text = "At node [Honey Mead], add 1 \"Honey Mead\" to your deck— Arithmetica Cost 1, gain 1 stack of Temporary Barrier, Exhaust."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_5_CN = {
    Text = "At the \"Proxy's Ceremony\" node in stages \"The Indulgent\" and beyond, gain the \"Divine Limb\" effect—deal damage equal to 10% of your team's Max HP to the front-row enemy at turn end.\nAdd one \"Emissary's Verdict\" to your deck—0 Arithmetica Cost, playing it consumes 10% of current HP, causing \"Divine Limb\" to deal 3× DMG to back-row enemies, or 10× DMG if in a Boss Battle. Exhaust."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_6_CN = {
    Text = "At \"Pale Sails,\" add one \"Utopian Veil\" to your deck. 1 Arithmetica Cost. View 3 Posses different from the currently equipped ones, choose 1 to Unleash immediately, which does not trigger Posse cooldown. Can be used 1 additional time during Boss Battle. Exhaust."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_7_CN = {
    Text = "Near the starting point of exploration, you will encounter a Special Resonance Event— <TutorialHighlight:Nourishing Mother>. Select a Command Card to gain the special <TutorialHighlight:Birth> Orison, but also gain 3 random Symptom Cards.\n<TutorialHighlight:Birth> Orison: Grants the card Retain. At turn end, if still in hand, gain an additional Base Copy of this card with Exhaust and Retain."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_8_CN = {
    Text = [[
A Special Resonance Event [Entrance Ceremony] can be found near the Starting Point, adding [Polar Dusklight] to your deck.
[Polar Dusklight]: Select 1 Command Card from your Draw Pile or Discard Pile, place it in your hand, and reduce its Arithmetica Cost to 0. (Single use, then Exhausted.)]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_9_CN = {
    Text = "Explore near the starting point to trigger the Special Resonance Event [Entrance Ceremony]. Add [Polar Dusklight] to your deck, inheriting all bonuses from Chapter 8."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_D05EX_CN = {
    Text = [[
Gain the starting Relic "Expedition Team": Start with 30 Expedition Team members. At battle start, place 5 "Suspicion" cards into the deck. "Suspicion": When played, consume varying numbers of members to trigger different effects.
During the exploration, you will continuously face the dilemma of "Suspicion," resulting in losses among team members. Reaching a Contact Point provides a chance for rescue. Upon safe evacuation at the end, you will earn the "Medal of Rescue" based on the remaining number of Expedition Team members. The more people evacuated, the more powerful the "Medal of Rescue".]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_Horla_CN = {
    Text = [[
At the start of the exploration, gain the initial Relic "Horla's Pen and Ink": After the battle, gain 1 stack of "Pen and Ink." When "Pen and Ink" reaches 2 stacks, it is consumed to randomly place 1 "Imagery" card into your deck.
In the special Resonance event [Spring's Gift], you may choose "Compose Verse": Select 3 "Imagery" cards and have Horla craft a "Verse" for you.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_Lily_CN = {
    Text = "At the Resonance Event \"Producer's Myth,\" selecting the option \"Ask Partner for Help\" grants a choice of 3 Advanced Orisons."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_MLYM_CN = {
    Text = [[
At the start of exploration, add 3 buff cards to the deck: <DerivativeCardKeywords_57:"A Warm Family">, <DerivativeCardKeywords_58:"Sincere Friends">, <DerivativeCardKeywords_59:"A Peaceful Life">.
"A Warm Family": Gain 2 Arithmetica.
"Sincere Friends": Apply 1 stack of Weakness and Vulnerable to all enemies.
"A Peaceful Life": Draw 2 cards.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_Railway_CN = {
    Text = "To Be Filled"
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_SEWD_CN = {
    Text = "\"Desire\" Event grants a random Sinful Relic or Golden Relic; \"Penance\" Event purifies a Sinful Relic into a Blessed Relic; \"Redemption\" Event allows deleting a Symptom Card to obtain rewards"
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_Wangda_CN = {
    Text = "At the Resonance Event \"Secret Order,\" selecting \"Acquire Funds\" grants 25 Black Sigils and a random Silver Relic."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_x1_CN = {
    Text = "At the Resonance Event \"Lingering Consciousness,\" shuffle one \"Spare Brain Vat\" into your deck. \"Spare Brain Vat\" can temporarily store cards that have been used before, and you may decide whether to take them out and put them into hand depending on the situation."
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_x2_CN = {
    Text = [[
At the "Metempsychosis" Event, select one Awakener to transform into "Insectoid".
"Insectoid" gains 50% increased Aliemus Regen and Keyflare Regen, all Command Cards have -1 Arithmetica Cost, but are Exhausted when played.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_x3_CN = {
    Text = [[
At a "Pre-Feast Ritual" event, place 1 "Soulsfeast Special Blend" into your deck.
"Soulsfeast Special Blend": Arithmetica Cost 1. Temporarily increases all Awakeners' Crit. Rate and Crit. DMG by 10%. After playing "Soulsfeast Special Blend," place 1 material into it to grant a permanent specific effect for this battle!]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_Resonance_Group_Desc_x4_CN = {
    Text = [[
