  LanguageConfig_ReturnEventRewardSenderText_CN = {Text = "Doll"},
  LanguageConfig_ReturnEventRewardText_CN = {
    Text = "The mission of combating Dissolution is a one-way road into the unknown, riddled with traps and dangers.\n\"Saving the world\" is a cause too significant—and too easy to lose oneself in. Throughout the history of Mythag University, many young Investigators have been lured by their sense of mission, burning themselves out beyond reason.\nWe are all relieved that you chose to take a break. We cannot afford to lose another Keeper.\nEnough pleasantries. To help you get back into the investigation as quickly as possible, I have drawn up a reboot training plan for you. Follow it through, bring me the results, and I'll have rewards for you.\nAlso, Ramona has prepared some \"small gifts\" for you. She's missed you quite a bit."
