  LanguageConfig_School_Blood_Content_String_CN = {
    Text = "At turn start, <CardKeyWord:Embryo Fusion> +20 (increases with HP lost, up to 40). Upon reaching the limit, place 1 <CardKeyWord:\"Embryo\"> into hand.\nThe \"Exalt\" of the Caro Realm consumes <CardKeyWord:\"Embryo\"> to trigger the <CardKeyWord:Devour> Effect. After the first Devour each turn, gain a Shield equal to 2% of Max HP and Temporary STR equal to 1% of Max HP. (Increases with HP lost, up to 2×)"
  },
  LanguageConfig_School_Blood_Title_String_CN = {
    Text = "Scarlet Sacrifice"
  },
  LanguageConfig_School_Chaos_Content_String_CN = {
    Text = [[

Chaos Awakeners can break Realm limits to team up with other Realm Awakeners.
If there is a Chaos Awakener in any team lineup, they will additionally gain 100% Death Resistance.
At turn end and after releasing "Exalt," <CardKeyWord:Keyflare> +50.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_School_Chaos_Title_String_CN = {
    Text = "Cosmic Kaleido"
  },
  LanguageConfig_School_Dimension_Content_String_CN = {
    Text = [[
The first Command Card played each turn is temporarily copied into <CardKeyWord:Ultra Realm> and triggers its Leap effect.
When the Ultra Realm reaches its limit, gain an extra Ultra Round. During this turn, no cards are drawn, but all cards from the Ultra Realm are added to your hand. The Ultra Round can trigger all Leap effects.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_School_Dimension_Title_String_CN = {
    Text = "Dimensional Leap"
  },
  LanguageConfig_School_Ocean_Content_String_CN = {
    Text = [[
At the start of the battle, generate 1 Tentacle, which attacks front-row enemies at turn end.
Each Exalt triggers an additional Tentacle attack at turn end.
Every 3 STR increase Tentacle DMG by 1; losing 3 STR decreases Tentacle DMG by 1.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_School_Ocean_Title_String_CN = {
    Text = "Touch of the Abyss"
