    Text = "Suggested Translation"
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_1_CN = {
    Text = [[
Step into Londinium's treacherous night mists, Keeper. 
Your journey begins here.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_20_CN = {
    Text = "Suggested Translation"
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_2_CN = {
    Text = [[
Artists, madmen, ascetics, fools... This city is your gallery. 
Here, at the threshold of their tales, the waxen figures yearn for your arrival.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_3_CN = {
    Text = "The snows of Rye loathe slaughter. \nShe waits for you, seeking only a trade. \nShe offers the secrets you crave most—for a price that is always cruel, yet always fair."
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_4_CN = {
    Text = [[
Remember. Fight for memory; die for memory. 
It is our gospel and our epitaph. 
Beyond memory, we possess nothing.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_5_CN = {
    Text = [[
Before the stars fell, we prayed to the ocean: 
may the gentle tide carry us into slumber. 
May we return to our homeland's embrace, lost in a dream that never ends.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_6_CN = {
    Text = "Chant now—the ancient King beholds His throne once more. \nHis sacred decree brings the Divine Realm \nto every soul of true faith."
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_7_CN = {
    Text = [[
Listen, pray, summon, proliferate. 
Submit to the loftiest ideals and the basest desires. 
As the All-Mother, She endures through chaos and fear.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_8_CN = {
    Text = "The Eternal Lantern is lit. Its dim light illuminates the path to your final destination."
  },
  LanguageConfig_StorylineGuide_9_CN = {
    Text = "Give It your answer."
  },
