  LanguageConfig_SummonSelectAwakePanelDesc_CN = {
    Text = [[
1. Chronos Mandate:
Select 1 Awakener from the available list for this Chronos Mandate Awakening Event.
2. Recommended Wheel of Destiny:
After selecting an Awakener, their recommended Wheel of Destiny is automatically chosen.
3. Awakening Rate-Up:
Each SSR obtained through Awakening has a 33.33% chance to be either the selected SSR Awakener or its recommended Wheel of Destiny (probability shared equally).
If the SSR obtained is not the selected Awakener or Wheel, the next SSR is guaranteed to be one of them.
If the same Rate-Up item (Awakener or Wheel) is obtained twice in a row, the next Rate-Up will be the other item.
4. Locked Selection:
Once an Awakener and Wheel are chosen, they cannot be changed for this event.]]
