  LanguageConfig_TrinketConversionRuleTitle_CN = {Text = "Rules"},
  LanguageConfig_TrinketConversionRule_CN = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Transcription>
Transcription can change the type and value of Covenant Substats, with no effect on the type and value of the Mainstat.
During transcription, the types of Substats can overlap with the Mainstat, and the types of Substats can also overlap with each other.
During transcription, Substats will receive different strengths in their values.
After unlocking Covenant Transcription, any newly obtained Covenants by the Keeper will be automatically transcribed once free of charge.

<Title:Locking>
During transcription, if certain Substats need to be preserved, you can click the lock button next to the Substat to lock it; the types and values of locked Substats will be preserved during transcription.
Up to two Substats can be locked simultaneously.
Locking one Substat requires an additional cost of "Covenant Remnant"*20; locking two Substats requires an additional cost of "Remembrance Quill"*10.
When choosing to lock one attribute, you can check "Consume Remembrance Quills to Supplement Remnants"; if checked, if the current "Covenant Remnant" is insufficient, the corresponding number of Remembrance Quills will be consumed automatically to proceed with the transcription.]]
  },
  LanguageConfig_TrinketConversion_CN = {Text = "Transcribe"},
  LanguageConfig_TrinketCopyRules_CN = {
    Text = [[
1. You can obtain a Covenant after clearing the stages in the Verboten Covenant!
2. Stages with different recommended levels yield different amounts of Covenants.
 A stage with a recommended level of 25 grants 1 Covenant.
 A stage with a recommended level of 35 grants 2 Covenants.
 A stage with a recommended level of 45 grants 3 Covenants.
3. Unlock Reenact after completing the stage challenge, which allows you to immediately receive the task rewards for that stage. Each Reenact consumes an amount of Menophin equivalent to what is required for an Investigation.
4. For each chapter of the Investigation Event cleared, a Covenant stage is unlocked.
5. If you achieve a three-star clear on a high-difficulty stage, the progress for lower-difficulty stages will be automatically marked as a three-star clear.]]
  },
