  LanguageConfig_WeekChallengeInstructions_CN = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[Lightless Realm]>
The [Lightless Realm] consists of a series of high-difficulty Keeper Levels. Upon defeating the final boss and completing the investigation, Keepers will receive generous investigation rewards. Challenges in the [Lightless Realm] will not consume Menophin.

<Title:[Challenge Rules]>
After defeating the final boss in the Domain and completing the investigation, the Keeper can obtain a corresponding star rating for the investigation evaluation. As the star rating of the investigation score increases, different rewards can be obtained.
In different [Lightless Realm] levels, Keepers will receive unique initial Relic support that is only valid within the current [Lightless Realm] level.
Within the same [Lightless Realm] level, after successfully completing a specific Domain level, the current team lineup's Awakeners will be recorded. The same Awakener cannot appear in other Domains.
Keepers can reset progress for Domain levels that have been completed; upon resetting, the characters and star ratings used to complete that Domain will be cleared. Keepers can then readjust the team lineup and continue to challenge.]]
